s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-14T10:50:42Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T10:50:42Z","body":"Thanks @AdriaandeJongh. This should implement your suggestions\r\n\r\n> * there's a lot of margin here for some reason, a lot more than on the left side of that same subpanel:\r\n\r\nThe margin was to avoid jumping of the content when the container becomes scrollable, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116560#issuecomment-4934028053. But after looking at it again I think this should not happen often and be fine to leave away.\r\n\r\nAlso I changed the margin implementation so the scrollbar now also is affected by it since previously it would touch the top/bottom edge of the container. Though now it has a large margin on the right of it which I find looks weird as well but the Inspector scrollbar has this too so maybe it is fine.\r\n\r\n### Search Panel\r\n<img width=\"471\" height=\"225\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/43567b96-5693-4852-ba9d-7592582a6f94\" />\r\n\r\n### Inspector\r\n<img width=\"460\" height=\"123\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8f9b543-98bd-4971-bde1-41b5bc4fa84c\" />\r\n\r\n### FileSystem (doesn't have the large margin)\r\n<img width=\"394\" height=\"165\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c5697803-04da-4758-afbc-50c39b46e776\" />\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5292465348/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5292594630","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116560#issuecomment-5292594630","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin